    "description": "Play the latest Casino Games from the comfort of your own home or on the move. Whether you play for just a few minutes or a few hours, Eagle Casino & Sports is the on-demand escape of your everyday routine and into the exhilarating possibility of winning major cash! Take a pick from hundreds of Real Money Slots, Blackjack, Roulette, and Live Dealer Games.\r\n\u2028Dive straight into the action and start to legally bet on all your favorite sports, including pro and college football, basketball, baseball, hockey, and so much more!\u2028 \r\n\r\nSignup today and enjoy unique features of Bonus Games, Free Spins and Huge Paying Progressive Slots as well as whopping welcome bonus!\r\n\r\nCasino floor favorites\r\nEagle Casino & Sports offers hundreds of the latest and most exciting Slots including High Limit and Progressive Jackpot Slots with massive pay-outs.\r\n\r\nOur Slot library includes hundreds of your favorites and latest games including;\r\n\r\n\u2022 Crazy Money\r\n\u2022 Divine Fortune\r\n\u2022 China Shores\r\n\u2022 Cleopatra Gold\r\n\u2022 Starburst\r\n\u2022 Wheel of Fortune Triple Extreme Spin\r\n\u2022 Shamrock Spin\u2028\u2022 Gonzo Quest\r\n\u2022 Vegas Nightlife\r\n\u2022 Riches of Midgard\r\n\r\nLive Blackjack, Roulette & More\r\nTake a seat at one or our tables and experience the thrills of a real life casino at Eagle Casino & Sports lounge. Whilst playing you can chat to our fun and friendly dealers who are waiting to deal the card and spin the wheel\r\n\r\nMichigan\u2019s latest sportsbook\r\nWhether you\u2019re at home, betting live on the big game from your sofa or out and about, you\u2019ll score with an unbeatable range of markets with the Eagle Casino and Sports Betting app! \r\n\r\nEagle Casino offers the best odds on;\r\n\r\n\u2022 NFL and College Football\r\n\u2022 NBA and College Basketball\r\n\u2022 Major League Baseball\r\n\u2022 National Hockey League\r\n\u2022 Soccer (including the MLS and all major European Leagues)\r\n\u2022 Fighting (MMA, UFC, Boxing)\r\n\u2022 Tennis & much more!\r\n\r\nSimply download the app and be a part of the sporting action today!\u2028\r\n\r\nBenefits of Eagle Casino & Sports\r\n\r\n\u2022 Simple, secure deposits\r\n\u2022 Super-fast pay-outs\r\n\u2022 Excellent customer support\r\n\u2022 Exclusive games\r\n\u2022 Weekly Leader boards\r\n\u2022 Exclusive rewards\r\n\r\n\r\nDownload & Sign Up with our fast & simple registration process and get exclusive offers and promotions today!\r\n\r\n\r\nCustomer Support\r\n\r\nOur friendly customer support team is always on hand to help you with any question you may have \u2013 even throughout the night! Contact our Support Team at support@playeagle.com for any questions you may have.  \r\n\r\nEagle Casino & Sports is a Legal, Real Money Gambling app in Michigan. Users must be 21+ to play and located in Michigan. Eagle Casino & Sports is committed to responsible gambling. If you or someone you know has a gambling problem and wants help, please contact the National Council on Problem Gambling at 1-800-GAMBLER or visit https://www.ncpgambling.org/. Please gamble responsibly and only bet what you can afford. See full Terms and Conditions here: http://playeagle.com/terms.shtml.\"",
